WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
If your YouTube videos get a little bit

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.880
of traction, and then they just die, I

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.920
need to tell you something

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.680
uncomfortable. The reason has nothing to

