your SEO, and nothing to do with your

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:14.520
upload schedule. And definitely nothing

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:16.560
to do with renaming your file before you

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:18.560
upload. The real reason comes down to

